{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01454",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.73,
      "end_seconds": 2.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "Good afternoon, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 3.53,
      "end_seconds": 7.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 8.77,
      "end_seconds": 12.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Well, I've been having sore, gritty eyes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 13.54,
      "end_seconds": 16.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "How long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 18.44,
      "end_seconds": 21.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "About... well, nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.93,
      "end_seconds": 31.5,
      "duration_seconds": 9.57,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.72,
      "end_seconds": 43.77,
      "duration_seconds": 11.05,
      "text": "Eye drops helps a bit. Pretty moderate, if I'm being honest. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.15,
      "end_seconds": 50.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Is it accompanied by anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.85,
      "end_seconds": 75.32,
      "duration_seconds": 23.47,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get blurred vision after the screen as well. Let me think, the blurred vision after the screen? That's been for about a month. Erm, about blurred vision after the screen, pretty mild, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.66,
      "end_seconds": 77.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "I see, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.06,
      "end_seconds": 84.82,
      "duration_seconds": 5.76,
      "text": "Oh, and watery eyes. That's been about the same, about three months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.4,
      "end_seconds": 93.28,
      "duration_seconds": 7.88,
      "text": "I see, go ahead. Have you had sore, gritty eyes before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.3,
      "end_seconds": 102.5,
      "duration_seconds": 7.2,
      "text": "Yes, something like this happened last winter, and it went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.25,
      "end_seconds": 108.87,
      "duration_seconds": 5.62,
      "text": "Have you noticed loss of vision, sensitivity to light, eye pain or discharge?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.0,
      "end_seconds": 112.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.66,
      "end_seconds": 115.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "How are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.76,
      "end_seconds": 122.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.87,
      "end_seconds": 126.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "What about your parents, brothers or sisters, any conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.51,
      "end_seconds": 129.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "My father had bowel cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.09,
      "end_seconds": 143.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "Any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.77,
      "end_seconds": 148.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Uh, yes, wheat. I get itchy skin."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.45,
      "end_seconds": 154.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "Okay, a few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.48,
      "end_seconds": 172.7,
      "duration_seconds": 17.22,
      "text": "I smoke roughly a pack every two days. I only drink at family occasions. My partner and our baby. I hardly move around during the day. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.59,
      "end_seconds": 197.81,
      "duration_seconds": 7.22,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something? It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.89,
      "end_seconds": 207.86,
      "duration_seconds": 7.97,
      "text": "Eczema, for about a year. Yes, high blood pressure. An irregular heartbeat, for about ten years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.78,
      "end_seconds": 224.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 225.83,
      "end_seconds": 229.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "No, I've never been operated on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.83,
      "end_seconds": 232.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.56,
      "end_seconds": 239.63,
      "duration_seconds": 7.07,
      "text": "I'm on hydrocortisone cream, when needed. Amlodipine, once a day for my pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.78,
      "end_seconds": 243.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Do you know the dose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 248.7,
      "end_seconds": 257.01,
      "duration_seconds": 8.31,
      "text": "It's 5 milligrams. I take metoprolol, 50 milligrams, twice a day for the heart rhythm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.33,
      "end_seconds": 261.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "I'll just record a few vital signs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.87,
      "end_seconds": 276.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.44,
      "end_seconds": 293.54,
      "duration_seconds": 7.1,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 125 over 71, respiratory rate 14, temp 36.8 degrees, pulse 74, saturation 99 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 295.57,
      "end_seconds": 297.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.97,
      "end_seconds": 301.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "That's fine, I'll explain it soon."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.28,
      "end_seconds": 307.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Let me look at the area, I'll be gentle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 308.17,
      "end_seconds": 309.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "Does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.15,
      "end_seconds": 334.03,
      "duration_seconds": 7.88,
      "text": "The eyes are slightly red with no discharge and the front of the eye looks clear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 339.76,
      "end_seconds": 347.71,
      "duration_seconds": 7.95,
      "text": "That's the examination finished. So, based on the history and the examination, it points towards dry eye syndrome."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 348.71,
      "end_seconds": 352.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Is this serious, um, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 353.44,
      "end_seconds": 386.09,
      "duration_seconds": 32.65,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now dry eye syndrome is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let's get an eye test, for blurred vision. The treatment will be lubricant eye drops, 1 drop, four times a day, long term. It's for dry eyes. Take a screen break every twenty minutes and try to blink fully. Let me check I've been clear. What will you do once you get home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 387.51,
      "end_seconds": 395.33,
      "duration_seconds": 7.82,
      "text": "So, I take the lubricant eye drops, 1 drop, four times a day. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 396.66,
      "end_seconds": 403.23,
      "duration_seconds": 6.57,
      "text": "Alright, yes, exactly right. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 404.13,
      "end_seconds": 406.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Thank you, doctor, goodbye."
    }
  ]
}